#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "Spell Checker"
msgstr "Verificator ortografic"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The configuration options available here are used by all &kde; applications "
"that use &sonnet;, which is a frontend to various free spell checkers."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create root/affix combinations not in dictionary"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this option allows the spell checker to register as "
"<quote>correct</quote> combinations of root words with suffixes or prefixes "
"even if the particular combination is not listed in its dictionary database "
"of words."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Consider run-together words as spelling errors"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is selected, then words that appear in the dictionary separately, "
"but have been run together, are considered to be spelling errors. For "
"example, even though <quote>alarm</quote> and <quote>clock</quote> might be "
"in your dictionary, if <quote>alarmclock</quote> is not, it will be flagged "
"as a spelling error."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dictionary:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose from the available dictionaries, which one to use for &sonnet;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Encoding:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should select the one that matches the character set you are using. In "
"some cases, dictionaries will support more than one encoding. A dictionary "
"might, for example, accept accented characters when <emphasis>Latin1</"
"emphasis> is selected, but accept email-style character combinations (like "
"<userinput>'a</userinput> for an accented <emphasis>a</emphasis>) when "
"<emphasis>7-Bit-ASCII</emphasis> is selected. Please see your dictionary's "
"distribution for more information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Client:"
msgstr "Client :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose which of the installed client applications on your system to "
"use. For example, you can choose <command>ispell</command>."
msgstr ""
